{"seq":3,"slug":"rehabilitation-engineering","title":"康复工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/neural-engineering-frontiers/rehabilitation-engineering","wordCount":2146,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"康复工程\">康复工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"康复工程概述\">康复工程概述</h3><p>康复工程（Rehabilitation Engineering）运用工程原理和技术手段帮助残障人士恢复或补偿失去的功能。与传统康复医学的被动训练不同，现代康复工程强调主动参与、精准量化和智能化辅助，通过机器人、电刺激和虚拟现实等技术实现功能重建。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;康复工程技术体系&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;运动康复&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;感觉康复&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;认知康复&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;外骨骼机器人&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;功能性电刺激&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;假肢与矫形器&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H[&quot;触觉替代&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; I[&quot;人工耳蜗&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; J[&quot;VR 认知训练&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; K[&quot;脑刺激疗法&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"康复工程技术体系\"] --&gt; B[\"运动康复\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"感觉康复\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"认知康复\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"外骨骼机器人\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"功能性电刺激\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"假肢与矫形器\"]\n    C --&gt; H[\"触觉替代\"]\n    C --&gt; I[\"人工耳蜗\"]\n    D --&gt; J[\"VR 认知训练\"]\n    D --&gt; K[\"脑刺激疗法\"]</pre><h3 id=\"外骨骼机器人\">外骨骼机器人</h3><p>外骨骼是穿戴在人体外部的机电系统，通过关节处的电机或液压执行器辅助或增强运动。</p>\n<p><strong>下肢外骨骼</strong>（如 ReWalk、Ekso GT、傅利叶 ExoMotus）使脊髓损伤患者实现行走：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>髋关节和膝关节各配备一个有源自由度</li>\n<li>踝关节通常为弹性被动关节</li>\n<li>拐杖提供平衡辅助</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>控制策略</strong>分为三个层次：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>高层决策</strong>：识别用户运动意图（按钮、传感器或 BCI）</li>\n<li><strong>中层规划</strong>：生成关节轨迹（基于步态模板或优化算法）</li>\n<li><strong>底层执行</strong>：力矩/位置伺服控制</li>\n</ol>\n<p>步态轨迹规划基于中枢模式发生器（CPG）模型或有限状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{\\theta}_i + d_i \\dot{\\theta}_i + k_i(\\theta_i - \\theta_i^{eq}) = \\tau_i^{motor} + \\tau_i^{human}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0813em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0813em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0906em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为关节角度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i^{motor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0522em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电机力矩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i^{human}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为人体残余力矩。</p>\n<p><strong>上肢外骨骼</strong>（如 ARMin、H-Man）用于脑卒中后上肢运动功能恢复。辅助策略包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>被动模式：完全由机器驱动运动</li>\n<li>主动辅助：检测患者运动意图后提供部分力矩补偿</li>\n<li>抗阻模式：施加阻力增强肌力训练</li>\n</ul>\n<p>**&quot;辅助量最小化&quot;（assist-as-needed）**原则：仅在患者无法独立完成动作时提供最少必要辅助，最大化主动参与以促进神经可塑性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"功能性电刺激\">功能性电刺激</h3><p>功能性电刺激（Functional Electrical Stimulation, FES）通过电流脉冲激活瘫痪肌肉产生有用运动。</p>\n<p><strong>刺激参数设计</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频率</td>\n<td>20-50 Hz</td>\n<td>产生融合收缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉宽</td>\n<td>100-500 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>s</td>\n<td>选择激活纤维类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幅值</td>\n<td>10-100 mA</td>\n<td>调节力量大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>肌肉力输出与刺激参数的关系（recruitment curve）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>PW</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>PW</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>PW</mtext><mn>50</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(\\text{PW}) = F_{max} \\cdot \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-k(\\text{PW} - \\text{PW}_{50})}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PW</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PW</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PW</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为最大力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PW</mtext><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PW}_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PW</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为产生 50% 最大力的脉宽，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为曲线斜率。</p>\n<p><strong>FES 步行系统</strong>：表面电极贴片刺激腓总神经（足背屈）和股四头肌（膝伸展），配合预设时序程序实现步行功能。足开关或惯性传感器检测步态相位触发各通道刺激。</p>\n<p><strong>FES 自行车</strong>：交替刺激双腿股四头肌、腘绳肌和臀肌，使脊髓损伤患者在固定自行车上进行有氧运动。除运动功能外，FES 运动可改善心肺适能、减少骨质流失和预防深静脉血栓。</p>\n<p><strong>FES 的局限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>肌肉易疲劳（外部激活的运动单元招募顺序与自然收缩相反——先快肌后慢肌）</li>\n<li>开环控制缺乏感觉反馈，运动精确度有限</li>\n<li>表面电极选择性差，深层肌肉难以独立激活</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"虚拟现实康复\">虚拟现实康复</h3><p>虚拟现实（VR）康复利用沉浸式环境增加训练动机、提供丰富的感觉反馈并实现精确的运动量化。</p>\n<p><strong>镜像疗法原理</strong>：VR 将健侧肢体运动映射为患侧虚拟肢体的运动，通过视觉反馈激活镜像神经元系统，促进运动皮层重组。</p>\n<p><strong>适应性难度调节</strong>：根据患者实时表现自动调整任务难度，维持在&quot;挑战区&quot;（不过易导致无聊，不过难导致挫败）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{next} = D_{current} + \\alpha \\cdot (P_{actual} - P_{target})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为难度水平，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为表现指标，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为适应速率。</p>\n<p><strong>VR 康复的循证证据</strong>：多项 RCT 显示 VR 训练在脑卒中上肢功能恢复方面不劣于甚至优于传统作业治疗，且患者依从性显著提高。2023 年 Cochrane 系统评价确认了 VR 在改善日常生活活动能力方面的中等质量证据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"运动意图识别\">运动意图识别</h3><p>精准识别患者的运动意图是实现&quot;辅助量最小化&quot;控制的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>肌电（EMG）意图识别</strong>：表面 EMG 反映残余肌肉活动，通过模式识别提取运动意图。常用特征包括 MAV（均值绝对值）、RMS、WL（波形长度）和零交叉数。</p>\n<p><strong>惯性传感器融合</strong>：加速度计和陀螺仪检测肢体运动趋势，卡尔曼滤波融合多源数据估计关节角度和角速度。</p>\n<p><strong>脑电（EEG）意图识别</strong>：运动想象 BCI 检测运动相关皮层电位（MRCP）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 节律变化，提前 200-500 ms 预测运动意图。</p>\n<p>多模态融合框架整合 EMG、EEG 和运动学数据实现鲁棒的意图识别：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;EMG 信号&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;特征提取&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;EEG 信号&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;特征提取&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;惯性传感器&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;特征提取&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;多模态融合&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;意图分类器&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;运动模式输出&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"EMG 信号\"] --&gt; D[\"特征提取\"]\n    B[\"EEG 信号\"] --&gt; E[\"特征提取\"]\n    C[\"惯性传感器\"] --&gt; F[\"特征提取\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"多模态融合\"]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"意图分类器\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"运动模式输出\"]</pre><h3 id=\"康复评估与量化\">康复评估与量化</h3><p>客观量化评估康复进程是循证康复的基础：</p>\n<p><strong>运动学分析</strong>：三维运动捕捉系统量化关节活动度、运动平滑度（jerk 指标）和轨迹直线度。</p>\n<p><strong>平滑度指标</strong>（Spectral Arc Length, SPARC）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SPARC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></msubsup><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SPARC} = -\\int_0^{\\omega_c} \\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{1}{\\omega_c}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{d\\hat{V}(\\omega)}{d\\omega}\\right)^2} d\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SPARC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.4318em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4143em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1818em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.3918em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3918em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6238em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.1418em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3918em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.4718em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.4718em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3471\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3337l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>该指标对运动持续时间和幅度不敏感，纯粹反映运动控制质量——值越大（接近 0），运动越平滑。</p>\n<p><strong>功能评估量表与仪器化评估的对应</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>临床量表</th>\n<th>客观指标</th>\n<th>传感器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fugl-Meyer</td>\n<td>关节活动度、协同运动</td>\n<td>动作捕捉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10m 步行测试</td>\n<td>步速、步频</td>\n<td>足压垫/IMU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box and Block</td>\n<td>抓握力、释放时间</td>\n<td>力传感器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026 年，软体康复机器人成为新热点。气动人工肌肉（PAM）和介电弹性体驱动器（DEA）制成的轻量化手套和踝关节辅具，重量仅几百克，穿戴舒适度远超传统刚性外骨骼，适合日常居家使用。</p>\n<p>闭环 FES 系统结合植入式 EMG 传感器和机器学习控制器，实现了脊髓损伤患者的自主手抓握——大脑发出运动意图经残余 EMG 检测后自动调节刺激模式，恢复了 6 种常用手势。</p>\n<p>数字疗法（Digital Therapeutics）概念将 VR 康复训练与远程监护平台结合，AI 自动调整训练方案并生成康复报告。FDA 已批准数款用于脑卒中和慢性疼痛的处方数字疗法产品，标志着软件本身可作为独立治疗手段获得认可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个&quot;辅助量最小化&quot;控制算法用于上肢外骨骼肘关节训练：定义运动意图检测方法（EMG 阈值）、辅助力矩计算公式和适应性调节策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较表面 FES 和植入式 FES（如 FreeHand System）在手功能恢复中的优缺点。从选择性、疲劳、便利性和长期效果四个维度分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个 VR 康复游戏场景用于脑卒中患者上肢训练：明确目标运动模式（伸展、旋转、抓取）、反馈设计（视觉/听觉/触觉）和难度自适应算法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一名 C5-C6 脊髓损伤患者，肱二头肌和三角肌有残余功能，手指完全瘫痪。设计一个综合康复方案，整合外骨骼（哪些关节需要驱动）、FES（刺激哪些肌肉）和传感器（检测什么信号作为意图输入）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论康复机器人是否应追求&quot;完全自动化&quot;——完全由机器驱动患者运动是否等于康复训练？从神经可塑性和&quot;use-dependent plasticity&quot;的角度分析主动参与的必要性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>康复工程将机器人、电刺激、虚拟现实和智能传感技术整合为系统化的功能恢复方案。从外骨骼的力学辅助到 FES 的肌肉激活，从 VR 的沉浸式训练到 AI 的意图识别，每种技术都在特定场景中展现独特价值。康复工程的终极目标不是替代人体功能，而是通过精准辅助激发神经系统的自我修复潜力——&quot;辅助量最小化&quot;原则体现了这一核心理念。理解神经可塑性机制、掌握多模态人机交互技术、关注临床效果的循证评估，是康复工程师的核心素养。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"康复工程","id":"康复工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"康复工程概述","id":"康复工程概述"},{"level":3,"text":"外骨骼机器人","id":"外骨骼机器人"},{"level":3,"text":"功能性电刺激","id":"功能性电刺激"},{"level":3,"text":"虚拟现实康复","id":"虚拟现实康复"},{"level":3,"text":"运动意图识别","id":"运动意图识别"},{"level":3,"text":"康复评估与量化","id":"康复评估与量化"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"脑机接口","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/neural-engineering-frontiers/brain-computer-interfaces"},"next":null}